    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you are the target of a sphere ability or supernatural ability that allows you to regain hit points that does not grant fast healing, you heal additional hit points equal to your Hit Dice. The increase in healing can not be greater than the original amount of healing granted. When you are granted fast healing, the fast healing heals 1 additional hit point per round.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc60\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
